<h3>Activity1: Go for a Measurement Walk</h3><p>One group has FOUR students and measures <strong>at least TEN actual objects</strong> outside or in the classroom, using rulers that can show whole, half and quarter inches. Use this blank table for original student-generated data; no publisher fixed numbers exist.</p>
