<p>The pictured baseline is an INDEPENDENT EXAMPLE only. Student chooses the correct range/scale for their own dataset; it need not use a2–5 range.</p>
<h3>Gallery walk</h3><p>Display line plots and discuss comparisons of scales, object lengths, total X marks, modes and unusual values; support explanations and physical evidence.</p>
